1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Dante Config Editor 2026.1 Beta
Prepare and review Dante presets offline.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:12,000
One unified workspace
Open an XML file or a .dceproj project, then review devices, channels, alerts, and actions in a clearer interface.

3
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Immediate patching
Choose Rx channels on the left and Tx channels on the right. One click applies the subscription immediately.

4
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:27,000
Controlled replacement
The warning remains enabled by default when an Rx is already patched, and can be deliberately disabled.

5
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:34,000
Consistent renaming
Rename devices, Rx, and Tx with Enter, Tab, or Shift+Tab. Patch references follow the changes.

6
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:42,000
Device banks
Save sanitized roles, share banks, and add an independent instance without copying hardware identity.

7
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:49,000
Projects and profiles
The .dceproj format groups XML, notes, and metadata. Profiles apply controlled audio and network settings.

8
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:57,000
Validation before saving
The validation center reports identifiers, references, audio formats, and network inconsistencies before atomic writing.

9
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:04,000
Interactive synoptic
Arrange devices, follow connections, and export SVG or PDF without changing the Dante XML.

10
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:12,000
Channel label exchange
Exchange JSON, CSV, DMT XLSX/ODS, Allen & Heath dLive/Avantis, and Yamaha CL/QL files.

11
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:19,000
Windows and macOS
The Windows installer and Apple Silicon and Intel DMGs include .NET 8 and the French and English guides.

12
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:27,000
A free project
Every feature remains free. A GitHub star, feedback, or optional PayPal support can help the project.

13
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:35,000
Thanks to the contributors
Thanks to Tobi / @togrupe for DMT and his feedback, and to Charles Bouticourt for the Atomic Bomb idea.

14
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:42,000
A cautious third-party tool
Work on a copy and validate important preset structures in Dante Controller.

15
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:48,000
Dante Config Editor 2026.1 Beta
By Mamat
et ses agents
